    "expression_position": {
      "x": 6,
      "y": 518
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "まり",
    "text": "「よく仲良く一緒に保健委員会のお仕事とかしてるよ。良い子だよねぇ、あたしも嫌いじゃないよ」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 55,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 6,
      "y": 518
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "まり",
    "text": "「しかしまぁ、転校生くんねぇ？　何だか、どんなときでも一枚噛んでるねぇ……？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
